;; Cloudflare Pages Function for POST /api/intake -- compiles straight into
;; functions/api/intake.js (Pages picks up any *.js under functions/api/ at
;; deploy time). Mirrors gftdcojp/cloud-itonami's shadow-cljs.edn :edge-api /
;; :register-api convention (same ns docstring reasoning: :advanced is
;; required, not optional -- :simple leaves cljs.core/goog base-runtime
;; eval() calls in the bundle, which Cloudflare's production deploy
;; pipeline statically rejects regardless of reachability). This build is
;; deliberately narrow (`partners.edge.intake` requires ONLY
;; `partners.catalog`, zero transitive deps) -- the same "no shared-bundle
;; dependency" carve-out core cloud-itonami's own :register-api/:nudge-api
;; comments document as the reliable pattern when a bigger shared bundle
;; is fragile to rebuild.
{:deps {:aliases [:cljs]}
 :builds
 {:intake-api
  {:target :esm
   :output-dir "functions/api"
   :modules {:intake {:exports {onRequestPost partners.edge.intake/on-request-post}}}
   :compiler-options {:output-feature-set :es2020 :infer-externs :auto}}}}
